2
00:02:50,519 --> 00:02:55,500
[Text: 遠い。]
[Text: Distant.]

3
00:02:56,219 --> 00:03:01,000
[Text: わたしが目指す場所は、]
[Text: The place I aim for...]

4
00:03:02,119 --> 00:03:07,000
[Text: あまりにも遠い。]
[Text: ...is far too distant.]

5
00:03:09,919 --> 00:03:13,500
[Text: 歩いて、歩いて、歩いて、]
[Text: Walking, walking, walking,]

6
00:03:14,219 --> 00:03:15,800
[Text: バカげた夢だろうか。]
[Text: Is it a foolish dream?]

7
00:03:23,019 --> 00:03:24,850
[Text: 諦める理由なら]
[Text: If I wanted a reason to give up]

8
00:03:25,019 --> 00:03:26,850
[Text: 過去に捨ててきた]
[Text: I left it behind in the past]

9
00:03:26,850 --> 00:03:28,950
[Text: 僕だけの栄光路を]
[Text: This path of glory that is mine alone]

10
00:03:28,950 --> 00:03:30,350
[Text: 証明したいんだ。]
[Text: I want to prove it.]

11
00:05:50,031 --> 00:05:57,031
壊れた　僕なんてさ　息を止めて
Someone broken like me... holding my breath,

12
00:05:57,631 --> 00:06:03,731
ほどけない　もうほどけないよ　真実さえ
unable to untangle, no longer able to untangle even the truth...

13
00:06:04,431 --> 00:06:11,631
freeze　壊せる　壊せない　狂える　狂えない　あなたを見つけて
Freeze... Able to break, unable to break, going mad, not going mad, finding you...

14
00:06:12,031 --> 00:06:20,031
揺れた　歪んだ世界にだんだん僕は　透き通って　見えなくなって
In this shaking, distorted world, I gradually grow transparent and invisible.

15
00:06:20,331 --> 00:06:25,631
見つけないで　僕のことを　見つめないで
Don't find me... don't look for me,

16
00:06:26,031 --> 00:06:34,031
だれかが描いた世界の中で　あなたを傷つけたくは　ないよ
in a world someone else painted, I don't want to hurt you.

17
00:06:34,131 --> 00:06:37,631
覚えてて　僕のことを
Remember me... remember my very existence.

18
00:06:52,161 --> 00:07:04,961
無限に広がる孤独が絡まる　無邪気に笑った記憶が刺さって　動けない　動けない　動けない　動けない　動けない　動けないよ
Endless expanding solitude intertwines, memories of innocent laughter pierce deep, unable to move, unable to move...

19
00:07:05,261 --> 00:07:07,361
unravel

20
00:07:34,628 --> 00:07:41,328
変わってしまった　帰れなかった　二人が絡まる　二人が滅びる　壊せる　壊せない　狂える　狂えない
Everything has changed, couldn't go back, the two of us intertwine, the two of us perish. Able to break, unable to break, going mad, not going mad,

21
00:07:41,428 --> 00:07:47,928
あなたを傷つけたくないよ　揺れた　歪んだ世界にだんだん僕は
I don't want to hurt you. In this shaking, distorted world,

22
00:07:48,128 --> 00:07:57,428
透き通って　見えなくなって　見つけないで　僕のことを　見つめないで
I gradually grow transparent and invisible. Don't find me... don't look for me,

23
00:07:57,528 --> 00:08:02,928
だれかが描いた世界の中で　あなたを　傷つけないで
in a world someone else painted, please don't hurt you,

24
00:08:03,128 --> 00:08:12,128
だれかが仕組んだ孤独な罠に　未来がほどけてしまう前に
before the future unravels in a lonely trap someone set,

25
00:08:12,328 --> 00:08:16,328
思い出して　僕のことを
remembering my very existence.

26
00:08:17,128 --> 00:08:27,128
鮮やかなまま　忘れないで　忘れないで　忘れないで　忘れないで
Staying vivid... don't forget, don't forget, don't forget, don't forget,

27
00:08:27,228 --> 00:08:39,628
変わってしまったことに怯えて　換えられないことだらけの　凍えそうな世界で　覚えてて　僕のことを
frightened by what has changed, in a freezing world full of irreplaceable things, remember me...

28
00:08:45,628 --> 00:08:52,128
教えて　教えてよ
Tell me... break it...

29
00:08:52,628 --> 00:08:58,128
僕の中に　誰かいるの
Is someone inside me...?

30
00:09:17,278 --> 00:09:30,078
鉄の玉が正義の証明　貫けば英雄に近づいた　その目を閉じて　触れてみれば　同じ形　同じ体温の悪魔
An iron ball is proof of justice; if pierced through, you approach a hero. Closing your eyes and touching it, you find a demon of the exact same shape and body temperature.

31
00:09:30,628 --> 00:09:42,128
僕はダメで　あいつはいいの　そこに壁があっただけなのに　生まれてしまった　さだめ嘆ぐな　僕らはみんな　自由なんだから
I'm no good, but he's fine—even though there was just a wall there. Born into this, don't lament your fate, because we are all free.

32
00:09:42,628 --> 00:10:03,128
鳥のように羽があれば　どこへだって行けるけれど　帰る場所がなければ　きっとどこへも行けないで
If we had wings like birds, we could go anywhere, but without a place to return to, surely we couldn't go anywhere...

33
00:10:03,383 --> 00:10:07,263
ただ 生きるのは嫌やつ
Living just to live is unappealing...

34
00:10:08,323 --> 00:10:12,583
世界は 残酷だ
The world is cruel.

35
00:10:13,423 --> 00:10:18,503
それでも 君を愛すよ
Even so, I will still love you.

36
00:10:19,463 --> 00:10:28,303
何を犠牲にしても それでも君を守るよ
No matter what I have to sacrifice, I will still protect you.

37
00:10:29,283 --> 00:10:33,903
間違いだとしたって 二人だったりしない
Even if it's a mistake, we are not alone.

38
00:10:34,223 --> 00:10:40,003
正しさは自分のこと強く信じることだ
Righteousness means believing strongly in oneself.

39
00:10:49,963 --> 00:10:54,843
鉄の雨が降り注ぐジオラマ
A diorama where an iron rain pours down.

40
00:10:54,983 --> 00:11:00,743
テレビの中 影に見えたんだ 戦争なんて愚かな今日を
It looked like a shadow inside the television... foolish days like war...

41
00:11:00,943 --> 00:11:05,103
関係ない 知らない国の話
It has nothing to do with me, a story of a country I don't know.

42
00:11:05,223 --> 00:11:09,883
それならなんであいつに組んで
Then why do I side with them...

43
00:11:10,003 --> 00:11:14,943
黒い気持ち隠しきれないわけ 説明だってできやしないんだ 僕らはなんて矛盾ばっかなんだ
Unable to hide my dark feelings, unable even to explain... What a bundle of contradictions we are.

44
00:11:33,263 --> 00:11:43,423
この言葉も 訳されれば 本当の意味は 伝わらない
Even if these words are translated, their true meaning won't get across.

45
00:11:44,043 --> 00:11:53,003
信じるのは その目を開いて 触れた世界だけ
All I believe in is the world I touched with my eyes wide open.

46
00:11:53,743 --> 00:11:57,643
ただ 生きるのは嫌やつ
Living just to live is unappealing...

47
00:12:02,163 --> 00:12:06,543
世界は 残酷だ
The world is cruel.

48
00:12:07,163 --> 00:12:12,103
それでも 君を愛すよ
Even so, I will still love you.

49
00:12:13,023 --> 00:12:22,463
何を犠牲にしても それでも君を守るよ
No matter what I have to sacrifice, I will still protect you.

50
00:12:22,863 --> 00:12:27,743
選んだ人の影 捨てたもののしかばね
The shadows of those chosen, the corpses of what was cast aside.

51
00:12:27,903 --> 00:12:33,203
気づいたんだ 自分の中 育つのは悪魔の子
I realized what is growing inside me is a child of the devil.

52
00:12:33,823 --> 00:12:40,203
正義の裏 犠牲の中 心には悪魔よ来い
Behind justice, amidst sacrifice, come, demon in my heart.

53
00:13:13,018 --> 00:13:15,698
聞いてくれてありがとう！
Thank you for listening!

54
00:13:15,958 --> 00:13:25,348
そして、角巻わため 生誕祭 2024 リバイバルを見に来てくれてありがとうございます！
And thank you for coming to see the Tsunomaki Watame Birthday Festival 2024 Revival!

55
00:13:25,988 --> 00:13:32,778
今日でなんと、わためは8歳になりましたー！やったー！
Today, believe it or not, Watame turned 8 years old! Yay!

56
00:13:33,318 --> 00:13:37,878
みんなの応援があってこそ迎えられた8歳だと思います。
I think I was only able to reach 8 years old thanks to everyone's support.

57
00:13:38,318 --> 00:13:50,358
おめでとう！ありがとう！いっぱいありがとうございます。もう本当に、わためをいつも支えてくれて感謝してもしきれないぐらいです。本当にありがとう！
Congratulations! Thank you! Thank you so much. I really can't thank you enough for always supporting Watame. Thank you so much!

58
00:13:51,308 --> 00:14:13,948
今日はね、ちょっと暗めの、闇深い曲から始まりましたが、見てくれているみんなと、そしてゲストのみんなと一緒に、さらにいろんな音楽を巡って、そしてリバイバルしていきたいと思いますので、今日は素敵なライブにしましょう！
Today, we started with a somewhat dark, deeply gloomy song, but together with everyone watching and all the guests, I want us to journey through even more kinds of music and do a revival, so let's make this a wonderful live show today!

59
00:14:14,728 --> 00:14:19,298
あ、そういえば、このモニター、すごかったでしょ？
Oh, come to think of it, these monitors were amazing, weren't they?

60
00:14:19,298 --> 00:14:22,398
今まっ黒だけどね。
They're pitch black right now, though.

61
00:14:22,758 --> 00:14:40,358
これ途中で変身したんだけどさ、あと2回？いや、3回？いや、4回、何回だったかな？このモニターが変面するので、ぜひびしバシ！スクショット撮ってほしいなと思います。
It transformed midway through, and... wait, 2 times? No, 3 times? No, 4 times, how many times was it? These monitors change their faces, so I'd love for you to take lots of screenshots!

62
00:14:40,938 --> 00:14:50,338
そして、シャープ、角巻わため 生誕祭 2024でたくさんポストもしていただけると嬉しいです！
And I'd be happy if you could also post a lot using the hashtag Tsunomaki Watame Birthday Festival 2024!

63
00:14:51,218 --> 00:14:54,108
ラストには告知？そして、そのあとは
There's an announcement at the end! And after that...

64
00:14:54,108 --> 00:15:00,148
メン限ライブもありますので、最後までぜひ楽しんでいってください！
There's also a members-only live stream, so please enjoy it all the way to the end!

65
00:15:02,834 --> 00:15:04,654
次の曲にいっていいかな？
Can I move on to the next song?

66
00:15:04,754 --> 00:15:05,774
いいかな？
Is that okay?

67
00:15:05,954 --> 00:15:07,574
いいよ！
Sure!

68
00:15:09,554 --> 00:15:11,174
ありがとうございます！
Thank you very much!

69
00:15:11,914 --> 00:15:18,474
では、次はローリーなあの曲いきましょう！
Now, let's go with that loli-ish song next!

70
00:15:24,479 --> 00:15:34,799
[Title: 粛聖!! ロリ神レクイエム☆]

71
00:15:24,812 --> 00:15:27,932
ロリロリロリ神こわしこわれ
Loli loli loli god, break and broken,

72
00:15:27,932 --> 00:15:31,472
鐘を鳴らせばこのとおり
if you ring the bell, it's just like this—

73
00:15:31,472 --> 00:15:37,422
これは９歳のレクイエム
this is a 9-year-old's requiem.

74
00:15:38,952 --> 00:15:43,892
せーの！さわった逮捕！監獄で反省！1234
Ready, go! Touched? Arrested! Reflect in prison! One, two, three, four!

75
00:15:43,892 --> 00:15:47,732
ごめんなさいがきこえない
I can't hear your "I'm sorry"

76
00:15:47,732 --> 00:15:51,422
粛聖！ロリ神レクイエム！
Purge! Loli God Requiem!

77
00:15:52,342 --> 00:15:57,302
将来は、お嫁さんかなに、すかれたくない
In the future, I don't want anyone asking, "Will you be my bride?"

78
00:15:57,302 --> 00:16:03,762
頼み込んで、口を洗え、反省してあお、ね！
Beg for mercy, wash your mouth out, reflect on it, okay?!

79
00:16:03,762 --> 00:16:07,362
さあ、おまわりさん、連れて行って
Come on, officer, take him away!

80
00:16:07,362 --> 00:16:14,232
もうこれしか、取り柄のない、かわいそうなひと
He's just a pathetic person with no other redeeming qualities.

81
00:16:14,552 --> 00:16:17,932
おい！ちゃ！おい！ちゃ！おい！
Oi! Cha! Oi! Cha! Oi!

82
00:16:17,932 --> 00:16:20,562
その姿を闇に見せられますか？
Can you show that appearance to the darkness?

83
00:16:20,562 --> 00:16:23,472
おい！ちゃ！おい！ちゃ！おい！
Oi! Cha! Oi! Cha! Oi!

84
00:16:23,472 --> 00:16:26,122
はーい！ありがと！お疲れ様です！
Hii! Thanks! Good work!

85
00:16:26,342 --> 00:16:31,802
ロリロリロリ神降臨！マジやばヤツらに用心！
Loli loli loli god descends! Watch out for seriously dangerous folks!

86
00:16:31,802 --> 00:16:36,892
まともじゃないなら、早く消えてください
If you're not sane, hurry up and disappear.

87
00:16:36,892 --> 00:16:43,732
ロリロリロリ神降臨！鐘を鳴らせばこのとおり、とても優しくて
Loli loli loli god descends! Ring the bell and it's just like this—so gentle

88
00:16:43,732 --> 00:16:49,402
素敵なお兄ちゃん
and wonderful big brother!

89
00:16:49,762 --> 00:16:55,312
楽園でほら、寝ねしな
Look, in paradise, go right to sleep.

90
00:16:56,032 --> 00:17:03,462
世の中にはこんな気持ち悪い人たちがはびこっているんです。みんな、ささやきますよ？
There are such creepy people running rampant in this world. Everyone, shall I whisper to you?

91
00:17:04,432 --> 00:17:07,902
さわった逮捕！監獄で反省！1234
Touched? Arrested! Reflect in prison! One, two, three, four!

92
00:17:07,902 --> 00:17:11,512
ごめんなさいがきこえない
I can't hear your "I'm sorry"

93
00:17:11,512 --> 00:17:15,402
粛聖！ロリ神レクイエム！
Purge! Loli God Requiem!

94
00:17:15,402 --> 00:17:21,882
はい、牢獄にルミナさん？刑務所ミーティングの時間です
Yes, Lumina-san in the dungeon? It's time for the prison meeting.

95
00:17:21,882 --> 00:17:26,882
その鎖切った耳をゴリゴリかぽってよく聞いてくださいね
Please listen carefully while grinding down those chained ears.

96
00:17:27,352 --> 00:17:28,932
ざっこ！
Trash!

97
00:17:28,932 --> 00:17:30,092
ざっこう！
Trash!

98
00:17:30,092 --> 00:17:31,742
キモキモ！
Creepy, creepy!

99
00:17:31,742 --> 00:17:32,732
きっしょ！
Gross!

100
00:17:32,732 --> 00:17:34,522
うるさい！黙ったほうがいいですか？
Shut up! Wouldn't it be better if you kept quiet?

101
00:17:34,522 --> 00:17:36,392
嫌いです！
I hate you!

102
00:17:36,392 --> 00:17:39,042
ざ、ざ、雑魚はミットモナイ
Tr-tr-trash is pathetic.

103
00:17:39,772 --> 00:17:44,892
たあしやマネおにいちゃんおねえちゃん、もう希望もないゴミだおめら
Tashiya imitation big brother big sister, you're already hopeless trash, you guys.

104
00:17:45,252 --> 00:17:50,722
おぶつ消毒100番、こうゆうの結構ガチと
Buddha disinfection number 100, this kind of thing is pretty serious.

105
00:17:50,882 --> 00:17:54,032
粛聖！おいおい！
Purge! Oi oi!

106
00:17:54,032 --> 00:17:58,132
やめろ！やめろ！まじちゃん！おい！
Stop it! Stop it! Maji-chan! Oi!

107
00:17:58,132 --> 00:18:03,762
光のビームなのだ、全然許さんぞ
It's a beam of light, I won't forgive you at all.

108
00:18:03,762 --> 00:18:07,492
地獄の炎で背中を焼き尽くせ
Burn your back to cinders with the flames of hell.

109
00:18:07,762 --> 00:18:17,402
お前らよりこの骨の髄まで浄化する、一筋縄ではいかんから、海ビームなのでは、全然許さんぞ！
Purifying you to the marrow of these bones, it won't go easy, so with an ocean beam, I won't forgive you at all!

110
00:18:19,282 --> 00:18:24,812
ああ、この世の醜さを集めて描いてみるよ
Ah, I'll try gathering and drawing the ugliness of this world.

111
00:18:24,812 --> 00:18:30,702
真っ白なキャンバスが汚れて泣いている
The pure white canvas is soiled and crying.

112
00:18:31,362 --> 00:18:37,822
ロリふりの痛さは、さわってとても掴もう
The pain of loli pretense, let's touch and grasp it tightly.

113
00:18:38,192 --> 00:18:44,752
楽園などないから
Because there is no paradise.

114
00:18:45,992 --> 00:18:51,512
大きなお友達のみんなへ、お前らが打ち込んでいる今日には何のいみがあるの？
To all the big kids, what meaning is there in today that you are devoting yourselves to?

115
00:18:51,912 --> 00:18:58,622
ねえ、教えてよ、私ね、全然わかんないんだ！
Hey, tell me, you know, I totally don't get it!

116
00:18:59,582 --> 00:19:04,522
ロリロリロリ神降臨！さようなら笑顔でバイバイ！
Loli loli loli god descends! Goodbye, smile and bye-bye!

117
00:19:04,522 --> 00:19:09,842
ビーりおどうぞどうぞ、この手で押してあげよう
Beam of light, go ahead, I'll push it with this hand.

118
00:19:10,112 --> 00:19:15,682
ロリロリロリ神降臨！鐘を鳴らせばこのとおり、とても優しくて
Loli loli loli god descends! Ring the bell and it's just like this—so gentle

119
00:19:16,182 --> 00:19:21,302
素敵なお兄ちゃん
and wonderful big brother!

120
00:19:21,882 --> 00:19:27,462
楽園でほら、寝ねしな
Look, in paradise, go right to sleep.

121
00:19:27,942 --> 00:19:34,872
それが、きょうさいの、レクイエム
That is the 9-year-old's requiem.

122
00:19:37,712 --> 00:19:40,642
せーの！さわった逮捕！監獄で反省！1234
Ready, go! Touched? Arrested! Reflect in prison! One, two, three, four!

123
00:19:43,642 --> 00:19:50,272
ごめんなさいがきこえない 粛聖！ロリ神レクイエム！
I can't hear your "I'm sorry" Purge! Loli God Requiem!

124
00:19:51,272 --> 00:19:53,742
本当に気持ち悪い
Truly creepy.

125
00:20:13,777 --> 00:20:19,077
[Title: こちら、幸福安心委員会です。 作詩:鳥居羊 作曲:うたたP]
[Title: Here We Are, The Happy and Peaceful Safety Committee. Lyrics: Torii Hitsuji, Music: Utata-P]

126
00:20:50,589 --> 00:20:57,399
どうして みんなが 幸せなのだろう この世界のこと 聞きたくて 知りたくて
Why is everyone so happy? Wanting to hear about this world, wanting to know...

127
00:20:57,899 --> 00:21:05,489
水辺の公園で みんなが 耳を澄ませて ワクワクするね お楽しみの…
Everyone is straining their ears at the waterside park, feeling so excited for the treat...

128
00:21:21,097 --> 00:21:24,057
ハイ！ ハイ！
Hey! Hey!

129
00:21:24,667 --> 00:21:34,597
さぁさぁ皆さん 教えてあげます みんなが気になってること 疑問に思ってること 全部 教えてあげます！
Come on everyone, I'll tell you! Everything you're curious about, everything you're wondering—I'll tell you all of it!

130
00:21:35,587 --> 00:21:43,127
ええ 皆さんが幸福なのは義務なんです 幸せですか？ 義務ですよ！ 果たしてますか？
Yes, being happy is your obligation. Are you happy? It's your duty! Are you fulfilling it?

131
00:21:44,007 --> 00:21:50,407
我々幸福安心委員会は 皆様の幸せを願い そして支えます！
We, the Happy and Peaceful Safety Committee, pray for your happiness and support you!

132
00:21:51,087 --> 00:21:57,707
幸福なのは義務なんです 幸せですか？ 義務ですよ！ 幸福なのは義務なんです 幸せですか？ 義務ですよ！
Being happy is an obligation! Are you happy? It's your duty! Being happy is an obligation! Are you happy? It's your duty!

133
00:22:06,567 --> 00:22:16,057
ですから 安心しして義務を果たすように 皆様の幸せが 我々の幸せ 幸せですか？ 義務ですよ！ 果たしてますか？
Therefore, rest assured and fulfill your duty. Your happiness is our happiness. Are you happy? It's your duty! Are you fulfilling it?

134
00:22:16,777 --> 00:22:19,577
幸せじゃないだろ…
You're not actually happy, are you...

135
00:22:20,027 --> 00:22:28,627
講習 参収 銃殺 構えで歴史的 奇跡の19目 約束 医師の午後 3時に貼り付け 好きなの？ 選んでね
Lecture, inspection, firing squad, aiming for historical miraculous 19th... promised doctor's afternoon 3 PM nailing, do you like it? Choose!

136
00:22:29,427 --> 00:22:32,427
ハイ！ ハイ！
Hey! Hey!

137
00:22:32,827 --> 00:22:38,127
さぁさぁ皆さん 幸せだけが満ちてます 不満とか不満 何ひとつないでしょ？
Come on everyone, only happiness fills this place! There's not a single dissatisfaction, right?

138
00:22:39,277 --> 00:22:43,227
こわっ こわいな 幸せ付いてこわいな！
Scary, so scary, happiness is following us and it's scary!

139
00:23:27,827 --> 00:23:34,677
本当に みんなが 幸せなのだろう この世界の外 行きたくて 逃げたくて
Is everyone truly happy? Wanting to go outside this world, wanting to escape...

140
00:23:39,127 --> 00:23:46,477
水辺の公園で みんなが 耳を塞いで ビクビクしてたって 運命ね
Everyone is plugging their ears at the waterside park, trembling in fear—such is destiny.

141
00:23:58,827 --> 00:24:01,827
ハイ！ ハイ！
Hey! Hey!

142
00:24:02,227 --> 00:24:06,727
さぁさぁ皆さん 死にました！ オンリーのフッタkishiは死にました！
Come on everyone, they died! Only the foot-soldiers... have died!

143
00:24:07,177 --> 00:24:12,777
騒ぎに出るなよ 向こうに並べ それ以外は幸せに暮らせ 以上！
Don't come out to the commotion, line up over there! Everyone else, live happily ever after. That is all!

144
00:24:13,277 --> 00:24:20,127
幸福なのは義務なんです 幸せですか？ 義務ですよ！ 幸福なのは義務なんです 幸せですか？ 義務ですよ！
Being happy is an obligation! Are you happy? It's your duty! Being happy is an obligation! Are you happy? It's your duty!

145
00:24:20,527 --> 00:24:28,277
幸福なのは義務なんです 幸せですか？ 義務ですよ！ 幸福なのは義務なんです 幸せですか？ 義務ですよ！
Being happy is an obligation! Are you happy? It's your duty! Being happy is an obligation! Are you happy? It's your duty!

146
00:24:32,777 --> 00:24:43,527
幸福なのは義務なんです 幸せですか？ 義務ですよ！ 幸福なのは義務なんです 幸せじゃないなら 死ね！
Being happy is an obligation! Are you happy? It's your duty! Being happy is an obligation! If you're not happy, drop dead!

147
00:25:12,943 --> 00:25:20,763
忘れてしまったことだけを覚えている
I only remember the things I've forgotten...

148
00:25:22,043 --> 00:25:31,683
ぼやりと開いたあんなのの先で君と出会った
...meeting you beyond that hazy opening.

149
00:25:31,903 --> 00:25:41,643
名前も顔も分からない君なんだか懐かしいような気がした
Even though I don't know your name or your face, somehow you felt so nostalgic.

150
00:25:41,923 --> 00:25:52,083
お互いに穴埋めて行くようにふざけ合って笑い合って
We teased and laughed together, filling in each other's empty spaces.

151
00:25:52,603 --> 00:26:01,783
世界中 ああ 愛のどこかにいる君のため
For you, who are somewhere in this world... ah, within love's embrace,

152
00:26:02,323 --> 00:26:12,463
今 ああ 生きているよ 僕ら
right now... ah, we are living, the two of us.

153
00:26:45,283 --> 00:26:53,783
たとえこれが映し出された幻だとしても
Even if this is just a projected illusion,

154
00:26:55,103 --> 00:27:03,943
確かに感じる今君がそこにいること
I can truly feel that you are right there now.

155
00:27:04,263 --> 00:27:13,983
名前も顔も分からない君さようならしてしまえば終わりだ
If we were to say goodbye to someone whose name and face we don't know, it would all be over.

156
00:27:14,403 --> 00:27:23,643
君がいなきゃ穴は大きくなる構わないさすぐ埋まる
Without you, the emptiness grows larger... but that's fine, it will soon be filled.

157
00:27:27,063 --> 00:27:37,183
世界中 ああ 愛のどこかにいる君はどこ？
Where are you, who are somewhere in this world... ah, within love's embrace?

158
00:27:37,443 --> 00:27:46,983
今 ああ ここにいるよ 私
Right now... ah, I am right here, myself.

159
00:27:47,583 --> 00:27:56,863
当たり前一面真っ黒な世界真っ逆さまに落ちていく
Falling headfirst into a world that is pitch black by default...

160
00:27:57,083 --> 00:28:07,383
無意味だからこの世界には忘れられ記憶の辻褄を今の君の元手行く
Because it's meaningless, this world... I trace back forgotten memories, heading towards you right now.

161
00:28:17,323 --> 00:28:27,263
世界中 ああ 愛のどこかにいる君のため
For you, who are somewhere in this world... ah, within love's embrace,

162
00:28:27,403 --> 00:28:37,703
今 ああ 生きていくよ 私 無意味のまま
right now... ah, I will keep living... just as I am, meaningless.

163
00:30:31,406 --> 00:30:34,086
闇に溶けていくわ
Melting into the darkness

164
00:30:35,246 --> 00:30:38,506
息潜めたみたい
As if holding my breath

165
00:30:41,226 --> 00:30:45,326
煉瓦の病棟で
In a brick ward

166
00:30:47,326 --> 00:30:51,046
うまく歌えなくて
Unable to sing well

167
00:30:52,566 --> 00:30:55,666
切り札も持たぬまま
Without even a trump card

168
00:30:57,566 --> 00:31:01,406
並べ 赤い月
Lined up under the red moon

169
00:31:02,826 --> 00:31:05,486
震えて 私を
Trembling, as I embrace myself

170
00:31:08,766 --> 00:31:11,506
ねえ 想い出さないで
Hey, please don't remember

171
00:31:14,326 --> 00:31:19,146
黒い血の中で 私は 生まれてきたんだ
I was born within the black blood

172
00:31:20,106 --> 00:31:24,766
悪意の代償 望むがままにお前に
The price of malice, exactly as you wished

173
00:31:25,326 --> 00:31:26,586
さあ 与えよう
Come, I shall grant it to you

174
00:31:26,726 --> 00:31:29,166
正義を壊して 壊される前に
Destroying justice before it's destroyed

175
00:31:29,286 --> 00:31:32,326
因果の報い 払い共にゆこう
Let us pay the retribution of fate and go together

176
00:31:33,406 --> 00:31:36,046
名前のない怪物
A nameless monster

177
00:31:50,846 --> 00:31:53,526
稲妻がしてる
Lightning flashes

178
00:31:55,186 --> 00:31:58,486
鉄床もうるさくて
And the anvil is too loud

179
00:32:01,226 --> 00:32:04,006
思い出せないの
I can't remember

180
00:32:06,726 --> 00:32:10,106
あの日の旋律
The melody of that day

181
00:32:12,226 --> 00:32:15,626
雨は まだやまない
The rain still hasn't stopped

182
00:32:17,886 --> 00:32:20,986
何にも見えないの
I can't see anything at all

183
00:32:23,246 --> 00:32:26,286
ほら見て こんなに
Look, see how much

184
00:32:28,786 --> 00:32:31,126
大きくなったの
It has grown

185
00:32:34,266 --> 00:32:37,186
黒い雨 降らせこの空
Black rain falls upon this sky

186
00:32:37,346 --> 00:32:39,466
私は 望まれないもの
I am an unwanted being

187
00:32:39,986 --> 00:32:42,946
日々割れたノイローゼ 愛す
Loving the daily fractured neurosis

188
00:32:43,086 --> 00:32:45,266
同罪の傍観者たちに さあ今
To the equally guilty bystanders, come now

189
00:32:45,486 --> 00:32:47,846
震え正義を 壊して 壊される前に
Shatter trembling justice before it is destroyed

190
00:32:47,986 --> 00:32:50,526
因果の報い 払い共にゆこう
Let us pay the retribution of fate and go together

191
00:32:55,486 --> 00:33:00,026
名前のない怪物
A nameless monster

192
00:33:17,286 --> 00:33:20,106
神様は
God is

193
00:33:20,443 --> 00:33:23,883
残酷で
Cruel

194
00:33:29,906 --> 00:33:34,446
心の世界よ
Oh, world of the heart

195
00:33:59,986 --> 00:34:04,546
黒い血の中で 私は 生まれてきたんだ
I was born within the black blood

196
00:34:05,126 --> 00:34:09,826
悪意の代償 望むがままにお前に
The price of malice, exactly as you wished

197
00:34:10,326 --> 00:34:11,586
さあ 与えよう
Come, I shall grant it to you

198
00:34:11,726 --> 00:34:14,126
正義を壊して 壊される前に
Destroying justice before it's destroyed

199
00:34:14,286 --> 00:34:17,266
因果の報い 払い共にゆこう
Let us pay the retribution of fate and go together

200
00:34:17,846 --> 00:34:20,926
報いようもない怪物
A monster beyond redemption

201
00:34:21,146 --> 00:34:24,186
黒い雨 降らせこの空
Black rain falls upon this sky

202
00:34:24,346 --> 00:34:26,466
私は 望まれないもの
I am an unwanted being

203
00:34:26,986 --> 00:34:29,946
日々割れたノイローゼ 愛す
Loving the daily fractured neurosis

204
00:34:30,086 --> 00:34:32,266
同罪の傍観者たちに さあ今
To the equally guilty bystanders, come now

205
00:34:32,426 --> 00:34:34,846
震え正義を 壊して 壊される前に
Shatter trembling justice before it is destroyed

206
00:34:34,986 --> 00:34:37,526
因果の報い 払い共にゆこう
Let us pay the retribution of fate and go together

207
00:34:41,846 --> 00:34:45,586
名前のない怪物
A nameless monster

208
00:35:33,380 --> 00:35:38,180
しじまに響けよ my howling
Resound through the silence, my howling!

209
00:35:48,180 --> 00:35:53,180
整々と流れてく風景
Scenery flowing by so orderly...

210
00:35:53,180 --> 00:35:59,180
切ない綺麗な日々の中で
...within those bittersweet, beautiful days.

211
00:35:59,180 --> 00:36:04,180
差し伸べられた手は優しく
The hand reached out to me was gentle,

212
00:36:04,180 --> 00:36:10,180
鼓動にしだたる秘密の予感
A secret premonition dripping into my heartbeat.

213
00:36:10,180 --> 00:36:15,180
風に逆らう そう生きてきたから
Because I've lived going against the wind,

214
00:36:15,180 --> 00:36:21,180
君にやっと気付く もう一人じゃない
I've finally noticed you—I'm no longer alone.

215
00:36:21,180 --> 00:36:27,180
ざわめく瞬きは 黄金色の街へと響く
The bustling blinking echoes toward the golden city,

216
00:36:27,180 --> 00:36:32,180
つまびく道 金色の群れ 共に嘆く夜
A path we pluck, a golden swarm, a night we lament together.

217
00:36:32,180 --> 00:36:39,180
遠くへ伝播する想いは 殻を強くする
Feelings broadcasting far away make our shells stronger.

218
00:36:39,180 --> 00:36:46,180
後ろに君がいるから 私は迷わない 光射す道へ
Because you're behind me, I won't get lost, toward the path bathed in light.

219
00:36:55,180 --> 00:37:01,180
無力だから仲間を求め 凍えるから
Because we are powerless, we seek companions; because we are freezing,

220
00:37:01,180 --> 00:37:06,180
火を灯して 変化とともに進化していく
We light a fire and evolve alongside change.

221
00:37:06,180 --> 00:37:12,180
この結末は誰も知らない
No one knows this conclusion.

222
00:37:12,180 --> 00:37:19,180
君を信じる そう決めているから
Because I've decided to believe in you,

223
00:37:19,180 --> 00:37:25,180
どんな状況も乗り越えられるよ
I can overcome any situation whatsoever.

224
00:37:25,180 --> 00:37:30,180
月夜に一人 凛と咲く花
A flower blooming proudly and lonely in the moonlit night.

225
00:37:30,180 --> 00:37:35,180
恐れなのか 憧れなのか 向き合う夜空
Is it fear? Is it yearning? A night sky we face together.

226
00:37:35,180 --> 00:37:40,180
大地を駆け抜ける私と君が作り出す
Created by you and me as we dash across the earth—

227
00:37:40,180 --> 00:37:46,180
この物語 単純な未来じゃない
This story is not a simple future;

228
00:37:46,180 --> 00:37:54,180
湧き立つ情熱 この声に乗せよう
Let's put our boiling passion into this voice!

229
00:37:54,180 --> 00:38:02,180
空を飛ぶ羽がなくても 繋げられたから
Even without wings to fly through the sky, we were connected,

230
00:38:02,180 --> 00:38:12,180
この運命を選んだ 連動する防壁は七島に響いて
And chose this fate. Synchronizing, our defense echoes across the islands,

231
00:38:12,180 --> 00:38:19,180
何度も何度も その絆を確かめ合った
Time and time again, we confirmed that bond.

232
00:38:32,130 --> 00:38:41,680
あぁ 瞬きは 声響きへ響く つまびく道 金色の群れ 共に嘆く夜
Ah, blinking echoes out to the sound, a path we pluck, a golden swarm, a night we lament together...

233
00:38:41,680 --> 00:38:45,180
遠くへ伝播する想いは 殻を強くする
Feelings broadcasting far away make our shells stronger.

234
00:38:45,180 --> 00:38:51,680
共にいよう 側に君がいるから 私は迷わない
Let's stay together, because you're by my side, so I won't get lost.

235
00:38:51,680 --> 00:38:56,180
光射す道へ
Toward the path bathed in light.

236
00:38:56,180 --> 00:39:09,180
Missed my melody... 狼が止まることはない
Missed my melody... The wolf will never stop.

237
00:39:31,180 --> 00:39:36,180
[Title: PSYCHO]

238
00:39:37,180 --> 00:39:40,180
Hey, unhappy? わざと不幸ぶってね
Hey, unhappy? Acting miserable on purpose,

239
00:39:40,180 --> 00:39:43,180
Into disorder 吸い込まれていく
Sucked into disorder...

240
00:39:43,180 --> 00:39:46,180
地球もそろそろ回り疲れて
The earth is getting tired of spinning soon.

241
00:39:46,180 --> 00:39:49,180
あけちゃえば 熱いつま先まで転がる
If we open up, it rolls all the way to our hot toes.

242
00:39:49,180 --> 00:39:53,180
輪廻転生 繰り返される道行き
The journey of reincarnation repeating over and over,

243
00:39:53,180 --> 00:39:56,180
つまらないセプトとトセイン
Boring concepts and toss-ins.

244
00:39:56,180 --> 00:39:59,180
背をごちゃまぜ 煮詰めて召し上がれ
Mix our backs together, simmer it down and bon appétit!

245
00:39:59,180 --> 00:40:02,161
悪意が僕を寂しくしてやまない
Malice never stops making me lonely.

246
00:40:02,385 --> 00:40:07,085
ジャックシャッフル踏んで サイコサイコー！
Step to the jack shuffle, psycho psycho!

247
00:40:07,185 --> 00:40:11,285
愛したいの生かしたいの壊したいの曖昧な世界が僕らをも嫌うんだ
Wanting to love, wanting to let live, wanting to break—this ambiguous world hates us too!

248
00:40:11,585 --> 00:40:17,685
ああ...
Ah...

249
00:40:18,005 --> 00:40:22,005
左も右手も取り戻せない先　今西がみついててカプセル
Left and right hands, the future you can't take back—clinging tight to the capsule for now!

250
00:40:22,285 --> 00:40:26,085
赤い飯して　おどけ様が　残酷は天使の連鎖して
Eating a red meal, acting playful, cruelty chaining the angel's madness!

251
00:40:26,605 --> 00:40:30,605
揺れながらも手放すな理性！今はにしがみついててカプセル
Swaying while holding onto reason! Clinging tight to the capsule for now!

252
00:40:31,205 --> 00:40:37,205
ジャックシャッフル踏んで サイコサイコー！
Step to the jack shuffle, psycho psycho!

253
00:40:39,765 --> 00:40:43,665
ジャックシャッフル踏んで サイコサイコー！
Step to the jack shuffle, psycho psycho!

254
00:40:45,865 --> 00:40:50,165
知り足捨てよう　軽口はめちゃくちゃ　刺してほらその細い針
Cast away the hind legs, casual talk is a mess—pierce with that thin needle, look!

255
00:40:51,165 --> 00:40:56,365
深い痛んだ迷いなくが日でも中心溶けてしょ　これが現実でしょ！
Deep pain, even without hesitation, the center melts—this is reality, right?!

256
00:40:57,165 --> 00:41:00,065
ひどくに染まる愛　直情的な恋
Love dyed in cruelty, headstrong romance...

257
00:41:00,365 --> 00:41:02,965
僕はどこまで蹴るのか
How far will I keep kicking?

258
00:41:03,465 --> 00:41:09,965
見にくいな汚いな美しいな素晴らしいな自分だよ僕を受け止めて
It's unsightly, dirty, beautiful, wonderful—it's myself, accept me!

259
00:41:09,965 --> 00:41:14,965
ああ...
Ah...

260
00:41:26,365 --> 00:41:31,965
おらさいさっきも来たよ　おバカもんのストレス社会発散で
Hey, look, came here again—letting off steam from this foolish stress society!

261
00:41:33,165 --> 00:41:37,665
僕はひたすらこの楽園を生き抜いてやろう
I'll desperately survive this paradise!

262
00:41:38,265 --> 00:41:44,665
左も右手も取り戻せない先　今西がみついててカプセル
Left and right hands, the future you can't take back—clinging tight to the capsule for now!

263
00:41:46,065 --> 00:41:49,965
赤い飯して　おどけ様が　残酷は天使の連鎖して
Eating a red meal, acting playful, cruelty chaining the angel's madness!

264
00:41:50,365 --> 00:41:56,665
揺れながらも手放すな理性！今はにしがみついててカプセル
Swaying while holding onto reason! Clinging tight to the capsule for now!

265
00:42:00,165 --> 00:42:03,665
僕がいつか切るまで只々飛んで
Until I finally cut loose, just flying...

266
00:42:04,265 --> 00:42:08,965
ハイウェイゼ　テッシャオイライライ
On the highway, teshio oira rai rai!

267
00:42:09,665 --> 00:42:15,665
ジャックシャッフル踏んで サイコサイコー！
Step to the jack shuffle, psycho psycho!

